+# Q3 revenue drop: East
+
+East had the steepest revenue fall of any region from Q2 to Q3: down 29.79%, from 333,747.57 to 234,325.08 (−99,422.49). Ledger Pro accounts for most of it. Its East revenue went from 106,520.77 in Q2 to 23,015.24 in Q3 (−83,505.53, about 84% of the region's drop), because it had far fewer completed sales: 22–28 a month in July–September against roughly 100 a month before and after. The other products fell by between 2.9k and 7.6k each, and Audit Add-on grew by 5.6k. Revenue is units × unit_price over completed rows only, with refunds (negative units) included. Note that the export includes rows dated up to 2026-12-31, so Q4 contains dates that are still in the future.
+
+| Quarter | East revenue | Change vs previous quarter |
+|---|---:|---:|
+| Q1 | 333,565.48 | — |
+| Q2 | 333,747.57 | +0.05% |
+| Q3 | 234,325.08 | −29.79% |
+| Q4 | 305,168.76 | +30.23% |
